// One fused launch. 128-bit loads/stores, one float4 per thread, one-shot grid.
// Loads carry L2 evict_first, stores L2 evict_last (constant cache policies; in SASS the policy sits in the memory
// descriptor register, so the suffix reads LDG.E.128 / STG.E.128): the harness's zero-fill flush leaves L2 full of
// dirty lines, and this pairing minimises the write-backs that land inside the timed window.
