//   grid <= 64 CTAs (n <= 65536):   clusters of 16 (non-portable) + cooperative attribute, -0.14..-0.22 us
//   grid <= 1184 CTAs (n <= ~1.2M): cluster dimension 1 + cooperative attribute,            -0.18..-0.23 us at >= 160K
